Package: viaunix-auth
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: brunogmenezes <brunogmenezes@hotmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, libpam-modules, libpam-runtime, ca-certificates, dconf-cli
Description: Autenticacao de usuarios do ViaUnix via API Jupiter
 Integra o PAM (login grafico GDM, bloqueio de tela, SSH) a API
 https://api.jupiter.com.br/action/Usuario/logar, com criacao automatica
 de usuario local sem sudo e cache offline opcional com revogacao.
